      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Litterally in the QM settings menu. option to disable self touch.\nhowever this does lead into a extention to this question of 'can we get an option to exclude certain bones from interacting with this? \nso we can prevent the left hand from grabbing onto things that rest near the left hand but still allow the right hand to grab them.",
