  "details": "Currently as far as I know there isn't a way to prevent yourself from grabbing your own physbones but still be grabbable by others. For avatars that may have tassels, ribbons, or various other ornaments on their wrists using gestures will essentially always cause them to be grabbed when not intended or can prevent you from grabbing your intended target when you are trying to grab something as the bones may be too close to the large grabbing radius.",
